    {
      "id": "exceptions",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "边界与例外",
      "headline": "什么时候孟德尔定律“失效”？",
      "lead": "基因连锁、交叉互换与细胞质遗传说明，定律的成立需要特定前提。",
      "notes": "本页要让学生明白，孟德尔定律并不是“错了”，而是有前提：基因位于不同对染色体或同一条染色体上相距很远。上一页我们刚看到减数分裂中同源染色体分离、非同源染色体自由组合，这正是定律的物理基础；当基因连锁在同一条染色体上，或者存在上位效应、不完全显性、致死基因等情况时，子代比例就会偏离 9:3:3:1 或 3:1。学生常误以为比例不对就是定律失效，其实恰恰相反，这些偏差帮助我们发现连锁、交换和其他遗传机制。下一页的杂交模拟器会让你们亲手转动基因型旋钮，观察在什么条件下经典比例成立、什么条件下“失效”。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "compare",
          "left": {
            "caption": "自由组合（基因位于不同染色体）",
            "block": {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "位置：豌豆籽粒形状 R/r 与颜色 Y/y 分别位于两对不同的同源染色体上。"
                },
                {
                  "text": "行为：减数分裂 I 后期，非同源染色体自由组合，非等位基因独立分配。"
                },
                {
                  "text": "测交：RrYy × rryy，子代四种表型比例约为 $1:1:1:1$。"
                },
                {
                  "text": "本质：亲本型与重组型配子数量相等，基因之间没有“绑定”。"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "right": {
            "caption": "基因连锁（基因位于同一染色体）",
            "block": {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "位置：果蝇体色 B/b（灰身/黑身）与翅形 Vg/vg（长翅/残翅）位于同一对第 2 染色体上。"
                },
                {
                  "text": "行为：染色体作为整体倾向进入同一配子，只有交叉互换才能产生重组型配子。"
                },
                {
                  "text": "测交：BbVgvg × bbvgvg，亲本型各占约 41.5%，重组型各占约 8.5%（重组率约 17%）。"
                },
                {
                  "text": "本质：基因物理“绑定”在同一条染色体上，重组型远少于亲本型；连锁越紧密，重组率越低。"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "id": "b_exc_compare"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "关键机制",
          "text": "**交叉互换**使同源染色体的非姐妹染色单体在减数第一次分裂前期发生片段交换，从而产生少量**重组型配子**，这正是连锁基因后代比例偏离孟德尔独立分配预期的直接原因。",
          "id": "b_exc_callout"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "lead": "基因不在细胞核内",
              "text": "细胞质遗传由**线粒体**或**叶绿体**中的基因控制，这些基因位于细胞核外的环状 DNA 上，减数分裂时不会随染色体均等分离。",
              "icon": "dna"
            },
            {
              "lead": "母本提供几乎全部细胞质",
              "text": "卵细胞体积大，含有成千上万个线粒体；精子进入卵细胞时主要贡献细胞核，细胞质（包括线粒体）极少被保留，因此子代细胞质基因几乎只来自**母本**。",
              "icon": "dollar-sign"
            },
            {
              "lead": "正反交结果不一致",
              "fragment": "fade-up",
              "text": "以紫茉莉（*Mirabilis jalapa*）花斑枝条为例：花斑母本 × 绿色父本 → 子代全为花斑；绿色母本 × 花斑父本 → 子代全为绿色。这与核基因的 $3:1$ 或 $9:3:3:1$ 比例完全不同。",
              "icon": "dna"
            },
            {
              "lead": "人类疾病实例",
              "text": "Leber 遗传性视神经病变（LHON）由线粒体 `MT-ND4` 等基因突变引起，患者母亲会把突变传给所有子女，但父亲患病不会传给后代，也不出现孟德尔式的显隐性分离比。",
              "icon": "pie-chart"
            },
            {
              "lead": "判断关键",
              "text": "若某性状在系谱中表现为“母病子女全病、父病子女不病”，且正反交结果不同，就应考虑细胞质遗传，而不是孟德尔定律失效。",
              "icon": "gauge"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b_exc_list"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "index",
        "steps": [
          {
            "label": "自由组合 vs 基因连锁",
            "blockIds": [
              "b_exc_compare"
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "交叉互换产生重组配子",
            "blockIds": [
              "b_exc_callout"
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "细胞质遗传",
            "blockIds": [
              "b_exc_list"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sim-cross",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "计算建模",
      "headline": "杂交模拟器：转动基因型旋钮",
      "lead": "改变亲本基因型与样本量，观察子代基因型与表型比例如何随概率规则变化。",
      "notes": "本页让学生通过“转动”亲本基因型旋钮，直观看到子代基因型与表现型的出现频率；要强调模拟器每一次输出都是一次随机受精事件，样本量足够大时才接近理论比例，小样本往往会偏离，这是学生最容易把“概率”当成“必然”的误区。承接上一页孟德尔定律“失效”的情境，这里先假设定律成立，让学生体会即便定律适用，真实结果也有随机波动；同时为下一页用棋盘格、分支图做精确比例预测做铺垫，让他们理解这些工具正是为了把随机结果变成可计算的预期。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget {\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    padding-bottom: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n  .field {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .field.grow {\n    flex: 1 1 220px;\n    min-width: 180px;\n  }\n  label {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--text2);\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n  }\n  select {\n    background: var(--card);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    padding: 5px 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: border-color 150ms;\n  }\n  select:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }\n  .cross {\n    color: var(--text2);\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin: 0 4px;\n  }\n  input[type=range] {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 80px;\n    accent-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .val {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    min-width: 56px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  button {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: filter 150ms, transform 150ms;\n  }\n  button:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }\n  button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }\n  .stage {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    min-height: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .hairline { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }\n  .label { fill: var(--text2); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; }\n  .gamete { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; }\n  .cell-text { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; text-anchor: middle; }\n  .bar-obs { fill: var(--accent); transition: y 450ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), height 450ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }\n  .bar-exp { fill: var(--line); opacity: .35; transition: y 450ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), height 450ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }\n  .bar-label-wrap { transition: transform 450ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }\n  .bar-label { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: middle; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .category { fill: var(--text2); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; text-anchor: middle; }\n  .ratio { fill: var(--text2); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; }\n  .flash { animation: flashFill 300ms ease; }\n  .flash-ratio { animation: flashOp 300ms ease; }\n  @keyframes flashFill { 0%{fill: var(--accent);} 100%{fill: var(--ink);} }\n  @keyframes flashOp { 0%{opacity: 1;} 50%{opacity: .5;} 100%{opacity: 1;} }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"parent1\">亲本1</label>\n      <select id=\"parent1\">\n        <option value=\"AA\">AA</option>\n        <option value=\"Aa\" selected>Aa</option>\n        <option value=\"aa\">aa</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"cross\">×</span>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"parent2\">亲本2</label>\n      <select id=\"parent2\">\n        <option value=\"AA\">AA</option>\n        <option value=\"Aa\" selected>Aa</option>\n        <option value=\"aa\">aa</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field grow\">\n      <label for=\"sampleSize\">样本量</label>\n      <input type=\"range\" id=\"sampleSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"1000\" step=\"10\" value=\"200\">\n      <span class=\"val\" id=\"sampleSizeVal\">200 个</span>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"reroll\">重新抽样</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stage\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 360\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n      <g id=\"punnett\" transform=\"translate(40,60)\">\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-28\" class=\"label\">Punnett 方格</text>\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-12\" class=\"label\">亲本2 配子 →</text>\n        <text x=\"-12\" y=\"0\" class=\"label\" transform=\"rotate(-90,-12,0)\">亲本1 配子</text>\n\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"0\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"160\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"160\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"160\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"160\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"80\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n\n        <text id=\"p2g0\" x=\"40\" y=\"-8\" class=\"gamete\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text>\n        <text id=\"p2g1\" x=\"120\" y=\"-8\" class=\"gamete\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a</text>\n        <text id=\"p1g0\" x=\"-8\" y=\"40\" class=\"gamete\" text-anchor=\"end\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">A</text>\n        <text id=\"p1g1\" x=\"-8\" y=\"120\" class=\"gamete\" text-anchor=\"end\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">a</text>\n\n        <g id=\"punnett-cells\">\n          <g transform=\"translate(0,0)\"><rect width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"transparent\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"50\" class=\"cell-text\">AA</text></g>\n          <g transform=\"translate(80,0)\"><rect width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"transparent\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"50\" class=\"cell-text\">Aa</text></g>\n          <g transform=\"translate(0,80)\"><rect width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"transparent\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"50\" class=\"cell-text\">Aa</text></g>\n          <g transform=\"translate(80,80)\"><rect width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"transparent\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"50\" class=\"cell-text\">aa</text></g>\n        </g>\n      </g>\n\n      <g id=\"genotype-bars\" transform=\"translate(240,80)\">\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-16\" class=\"label\">基因型</text>\n        <rect id=\"bar-AA-exp\" class=\"bar-exp\" x=\"8\" y=\"200\" width=\"32\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-AA\" class=\"bar-obs\" x=\"8\" y=\"200\" width=\"32\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-Aa-exp\" class=\"bar-exp\" x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"32\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-Aa\" class=\"bar-obs\" x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"32\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-aa-exp\" class=\"bar-exp\" x=\"112\" y=\"200\" width=\"32\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-aa\" class=\"bar-obs\" x=\"112\" y=\"200\" width=\"32\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"200\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <text x=\"24\" y=\"216\" class=\"category\">AA</text>\n        <text x=\"76\" y=\"216\" class=\"category\">Aa</text>\n        <text x=\"128\" y=\"216\" class=\"category\">aa</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <g id=\"phenotype-bars\" transform=\"translate(440,80)\">\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-16\" class=\"label\">表型</text>\n        <rect id=\"bar-Dom-exp\" class=\"bar-exp\" x=\"16\" y=\"200\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-Dom\" class=\"bar-obs\" x=\"16\" y=\"200\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-Rec-exp\" class=\"bar-exp\" x=\"84\" y=\"200\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <rect id=\"bar-Rec\" class=\"bar-obs\" x=\"84\" y=\"200\" width=\"40\" height=\"0\"/>\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"200\" class=\"hairline\"/>\n        <text x=\"36\" y=\"216\" class=\"category\">显性</text>\n        <text x=\"104\" y=\"216\" class=\"category\">隐性</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <g id=\"observed-labels\">\n        <g id=\"labg-AA\" class=\"bar-label-wrap\"><text id=\"lab-AA\" class=\"bar-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\">0</text></g>\n        <g id=\"labg-Aa\" class=\"bar-label-wrap\"><text id=\"lab-Aa\" class=\"bar-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\">0</text></g>\n        <g id=\"labg-aa\" class=\"bar-label-wrap\"><text id=\"lab-aa\" class=\"bar-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\">0</text></g>\n        <g id=\"labg-Dom\" class=\"bar-label-wrap\"><text id=\"lab-Dom\" class=\"bar-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\">0</text></g>\n        <g id=\"labg-Rec\" class=\"bar-label-wrap\"><text id=\"lab-Rec\" class=\"bar-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\">0</text></g>\n      </g>\n\n      <text id=\"expected-ratio\" class=\"ratio\" x=\"360\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\">预期基因型 1:2:1 · 表型 3:1</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  let parent1 = 'Aa', parent2 = 'Aa', sampleSize = 200, sampleSeed = 1;\n\n  const elP1 = document.getElementById('parent1');\n  const elP2 = document.getElementById('parent2');\n  const elSize = document.getElementById('sampleSize');\n  const elSizeVal = document.getElementById('sampleSizeVal');\n  const elReroll = document.getElementById('reroll');\n\n  const baselineLocal = 200;\n  const groupY = 80;\n  const maxH = 180;\n\n  const genotypeConfig = [\n    { key: 'AA', groupX: 240, barX: 8, width: 32 },\n    { key: 'Aa', groupX: 240, barX: 60, width: 32 },\n    { key: 'aa', groupX: 240, barX: 112, width: 32 }\n  ];\n  const phenotypeConfig = [\n    { key: 'Dom', groupX: 440, barX: 16, width: 40 },\n    { key: 'Rec', groupX: 440, barX: 84, width: 40 }\n  ];\n\n  const bars = {};\n  function initBars() {\n    [...genotypeConfig, ...phenotypeConfig].forEach(c => {\n      bars[c.key] = {\n        obs: document.getElementById('bar-' + c.key),\n        exp: document.getElementById('bar-' + c.key + '-exp'),\n        labg: document.getElementById('labg-' + c.key),\n        lab: document.getElementById('lab-' + c.key)\n      };\n    });\n  }\n  initBars();\n\n  const prevCounts = { AA: 0, Aa: 0, aa: 0, Dom: 0, Rec: 0 };\n  const anims = new Map();\n\n  function gameteProbs(g) {\n    if (g === 'AA') return { A: 1, a: 0 };\n    if (g === 'aa') return { A: 0, a: 1 };\n    return { A: 0.5, a: 0.5 };\n  }\n  function gametePair(g) {\n    if (g === 'AA') return ['A', 'A'];\n    if (g === 'aa') return ['a', 'a'];\n    return ['A', 'a'];\n  }\n  function canonical(a, b) {\n    if (a === 'a' && b === 'A') return 'Aa';\n    return a + b;\n  }\n  function gcd(a, b) {\n    while (b) { const t = a % b; a = b; b = t; }\n    return a;\n  }\n  function makeRng(seed) {\n    let s = seed >>> 0;\n    return function () {\n      s = (s * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\n      return s / 4294967296;\n    };\n  }\n  function flash(el, type) {\n    const cls = type === 'op' ? 'flash-ratio' : 'flash';\n    el.classList.remove(cls);\n    void el.offsetWidth;\n    el.classList.add(cls);\n    const done = () => { el.classList.remove(cls); el.removeEventListener('animationend', done); };\n    el.addEventListener('animationend', done);\n  }\n  function animateNumber(el, start, end, fmt) {\n    if (anims.has(el)) cancelAnimationFrame(anims.get(el));\n    const t0 = performance.now();\n    const dur = 400;\n    function frame(now) {\n      const t = Math.min((now - t0) / dur, 1);\n      const ease = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n      const v = start + (end - start) * ease;\n      el.textContent = fmt(v);\n      if (t < 1) anims.set(el, requestAnimationFrame(frame));\n      else anims.delete(el);\n    }\n    anims.set(el, requestAnimationFrame(frame));\n  }\n  function setBar(cfg, count, expProb) {\n    const prop = count / sampleSize;\n    const h = prop * maxH;\n    const b = bars[cfg.key];\n    b.exp.setAttribute('y', baselineLocal - expProb * maxH);\n    b.exp.setAttribute('height', expProb * maxH);\n    b.obs.setAttribute('y', baselineLocal - h);\n    b.obs.setAttribute('height', h);\n    const x = cfg.groupX + cfg.barX + cfg.width / 2;\n    const y = groupY + baselineLocal - h - 6;\n    b.labg.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;\n    animateNumber(b.lab, prevCounts[cfg.key] ?? 0, count, v => `${Math.round(v)} (${((v / sampleSize) * 100).toFixed(1)}%)`);\n    flash(b.lab, 'fill');\n    prevCounts[cfg.key] = count;\n  }\n\n  function update() {\n    elP1.value = parent1;\n    elP2.value = parent2;\n    elSize.value = sampleSize;\n    elSizeVal.textContent = sampleSize + ' 个';\n\n    const p1g = gametePair(parent1);\n    const p2g = gametePair(parent2);\n    document.getElementById('p1g0').textContent = p1g[0];\n    document.getElementById('p1g1').textContent = p1g[1];\n    document.getElementById('p2g0').textContent = p2g[0];\n    document.getElementById('p2g1').textContent = p2g[1];\n\n    const cellTexts = document.querySelectorAll('#punnett-cells text');\n    cellTexts[0].textContent = canonical(p1g[0], p2g[0]);\n    cellTexts[1].textContent = canonical(p1g[0], p2g[1]);\n    cellTexts[2].textContent = canonical(p1g[1], p2g[0]);\n    cellTexts[3].textContent = canonical(p1g[1], p2g[1]);\n\n    const pr1 = gameteProbs(parent1);\n    const pr2 = gameteProbs(parent2);\n    const exp = {\n      AA: pr1.A * pr2.A,\n      Aa: pr1.A * pr2.a + pr1.a * pr2.A,\n      aa: pr1.a * pr2.a\n    };\n    const expPheno = { Dom: exp.AA + exp.Aa, Rec: exp.aa };\n\n    const rng = makeRng(sampleSeed);\n    const counts = { AA: 0, Aa: 0, aa: 0 };\n    for (let i = 0; i < sampleSize; i++) {\n      const g1 = rng() < pr1.A ? 'A' : 'a';\n      const g2 = rng() < pr2.A ? 'A' : 'a';\n      counts[canonical(g1, g2)]++;\n    }\n    const phenoCounts = { Dom: counts.AA + counts.Aa, Rec: counts.aa };\n\n    genotypeConfig.forEach(c => setBar(c, counts[c.key], exp[c.key]));\n    phenotypeConfig.forEach(c => setBar(c, phenoCounts[c.key], expPheno[c.key]));\n\n    const genoNums = [Math.round(exp.AA * 4), Math.round(exp.Aa * 4), Math.round(exp.aa * 4)];\n    const gGcd = gcd(gcd(genoNums[0], genoNums[1]), genoNums[2]);\n    const genoRatio = genoNums.map(n => n / gGcd).join(' : ');\n\n    const phenoNums = [Math.round(expPheno.Dom * 4), Math.round(expPheno.Rec * 4)];\n    const pGcd = gcd(phenoNums[0], phenoNums[1]);\n    const phenoRatio = phenoNums.map(n => n / pGcd).join(' : ');\n\n    const ratioEl = document.getElementById('expected-ratio');\n    ratioEl.textContent = `预期基因型 ${genoRatio} · 表型 ${phenoRatio}`;\n    flash(ratioEl, 'op');\n  }\n\n  elP1.addEventListener('change', e => { parent1 = e.target.value; update(); });\n  elP2.addEventListener('change', e => { parent2 = e.target.value; update(); });\n  elSize.addEventListener('input', e => { sampleSize = parseInt(e.target.value, 10); update(); });\n  elReroll.addEventListener('click', () => { sampleSeed += 1; update(); });\n\n  update();\n</script>",
          "id": "b_sim"
        },
